---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Careers" description="HavenKeep is a small operation. Here's where we are and what we're looking for.">
  <Navigation />
  <main>
    <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-gray-900">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Careers</h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8">
            HavenKeep is a small founder-led operation right now. We don't have open roles posted, no equity-and-benefits package to advertise, no recruiter pipeline.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-12">
            If you genuinely care about building durable consumer software — especially in areas like trust, money flows, mobile reliability, or warranty / insurance domain knowledge — and you want to chat about what working together might look like as we grow, email
            <a href="mailto:hello@havenkeep.com" class="text-primary hover:text-secondary">hello@havenkeep.com</a>.
            We'll get back to you personally; we will not pretend a role exists when it doesn't.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-2xl p-8 text-left">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">What we value</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-300">
              <li><strong class="text-white">Take ownership.</strong> Find a problem; close it end to end. No "that's not my job."</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">Don't ship lies.</strong> If a feature doesn't work, don't put it on the website until it does.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">Be honest about scope.</strong> Estimate ranges, not points. Cut scope before you cut quality.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-white">Build for the long term.</strong> We're trying to be the warranty company that's still here in 10 years, not the one that grows fast and dies.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
